# Ensnaring Bridge's ruling: it checks the number of cards in its controller's hand only while attackers are declared; a
# creature that has legally attacked stays attacking whatever its power becomes (CR 506.4a). Bot2 holds one card under its
# Bridge. Bot1's Llanowar Elves (power 1) attacks on turn 3, and in the declare attackers step Bot1 casts Violent Urge on it:
# +1/+0 makes its power 2, greater than Bot2's hand, but it stays attacking and deals 2.

